    <bpmn:process id="W_W12B" name="W12B. Online-Initiated Returns" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer initiates return on website/app
Frequency: ~8–10% of ecommerce orders ≈ 3,300–4,200/month (~110–140/day, per the Volume/canon)
Volume: ~3,300–4,200 online returns/month chain-wide (~8–10% of ecommerce orders; ≈110–140/day per the corpus returns canon)
Owner: Customer Service Rep (receiving store)
Participants: Customer, CSR, Stock Associate, Ecommerce Team
Source: workflow W12B — Online-Initiated Returns</bpmn:documentation>
