Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W12B_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W12B_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
