        <bpmn:incoming>W581_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W581_Annotation17">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-259 (ensure controlled execution — Store Daily Management (PA-07.1).) | - operational: advance scheduling requirement (vendor must coordinate visit 24 hours in advance via Buyer); operational: zone-specific badge access and Security Guard monitoring; operational: requiring Department Supervisor presence during customer demos and BuildRight product knowledge training materials as authoritative source
Owner: Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
