      <bpmn:startEvent id="W665_Start6" name="Daily system-generated KPI refresh at 06:00">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W665_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W665_Task7" name="System auto-generates overnight KPI snapshot per store from POS, inventory, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System auto-generates overnight KPI snapshot per store from POS, inventory, and workforce data: sales (revenue vs. budget, ATV, transaction count, units per transaction), labor (cost % of revenue, overtime hours, absenteeism rate), inventory (out-of-stock count on top 100 SKUs, shrinkage incidents, receiving backlog), customer (NPS pulse, complaint count, queue wait time from W526), fulfillment (BOPIS SLA compliance, delivery orders pending)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): BI Analyst
