    <bpmn:process id="W_W667" name="W667. Store-Level Price Verification &amp; Daily Compliance Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily morning opening routine; system price change alerts
Frequency: Daily spot-check (morning); weekly comprehensive shelf walk
Volume: 200 stores × ~35,000 active SKUs; daily price-change bulletins affecting a handful of SKUs/store (chain-wide ~10–25 changes/day per W40; peaks to ~200 SKUs/store during promo/seasonal transitions)
Owner: Department Supervisor (daily); Store Manager (weekly audit)
Participants: Stock Associate, Cashier Lead
Source: workflow W667 — Store-Level Price Verification &amp; Daily Compliance Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W667_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W667_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W667_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
