    <bpmn:process id="W_W1490" name="W1490. Store-Level Plumbing &amp; Electrical Fixture Display Model Rotation, Demo Unit Tracking &amp; Write-Off" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly display refresh cycle; also triggered when display model is damaged, vendor launches new product line, or customer purchases display unit
Frequency: Quarterly major rotation; ad-hoc replacements as needed; ~2–5 demo unit write-offs per store per quarter
Volume: ~30–50 display fixture SKUs per store (faucets, toilets, showerheads, light fixtures, ceiling fans, switches); ~200 stores
Owner: Department Supervisor
Participants: Visual Merchandising Associate, Department Supervisor, Loss Prevention Associate, Merchandise Planner
Source: workflow W1490 — Store-Level Plumbing &amp; Electrical Fixture Display Model Rotation, Demo Unit Tracking &amp; Write-Off</bpmn:documentation>
